163 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We are an NGO dedicated to empowering underserved communities by leveraging technology and skills to create digital livelihoods. Since 2007, we have impacted 500,000 lives, offering job and entrepreneurship opportunities to youth and women in crisis. Our main motto is to provide employment for students, ensuring they are prepared for a brighter future. By partnering with top corporations such as Accenture, Microsoft, Wells Fargo, the Michael and Susan Dell Foundation, and JP Morgan, we align our training with the latest technological advancements and industry needs. We support diverse groups, people with disabilities, refugees, and marginalized communities, providing ongoing improvement and mentorship at our centers across India.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
