174 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Launched in 2022, Anudip's DeepTECH program emphasizes on driving coding literacy and technology amongst the business conglomerate. The demand for technology-dexterous developers like software engineers, application framework developers, and application engineers can increase nine times by 2025. Spanning across 12 states the program has facilitated over 2,000 placements by training participants in advanced programming languages like Java, Python, Cloud, and UI frameworks. Catering to the surging demand for tech-savvy developers, DeepTECH ensures new-economy employment with tech giants, placing participants on a growth trajectory.)
/E (Launched in 2022, Anudip's DeepTECH program emphasizes on driving coding literacy and technology amongst the business conglomerate. The demand for technology-dexterous developers like software engineers, application framework developers, and application engineers can increase nine times by 2025. Spanning across 12 states the program has facilitated over 2,000 placements by training participants in advanced programming languages like Java, Python, Cloud, and UI frameworks. Catering to the surging demand for tech-savvy developers, DeepTECH ensures new-economy employment with tech giants, placing participants on a growth trajectory.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
